# R6-2 (4) (the book §12: conversion and implements against the Consumer precede storage): the reference assignment a
# Structure body's `@: Model p Other` makes when it runs is refused where it stands when Other lacks Model's field v --
# implements is false; said at translation.
Model:
    int: v 11
end: Model
Other:
    int: z 1
end: Other
Holder:
    @: Model p Other
end: Holder
h: merge: Holder
h
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
